<title>USA: Micron Technology Q1 Nov 28 net falls.</title>
<headline>Micron Technology Q1 Nov 28 net falls.</headline>
<text>
<p>BOISE, Idaho, Dec 16 (Reuter)</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary     $0.10		    $1.51</p>
<p> Shr diluted     0.10		     1.51</p>
<p> Net		 20,600		   328,500</p>
<p> Revs		728,100		  1,185,800</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary214,000		  217,200</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted214,500		  217,200</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note - The company's net income in the first quarter of fiscal 1997 included a $6 million ($0.03 per fully diluted share) after-tax gain on the sale of an investment.</p>
